            "description": "Socket.IO WebSocket namespace.\n\n--- Client → Server Events ---\n• startSession  — { email: string }\n• audioMessage  — { sessionId: string, audio: base64 }\n• userMessage   — { sessionId: string, text: string }\n\n--- Server → Client Events ---\n• sessionStarted       — { sessionId, participantId, greeting }\n• processing           — { status: string }\n• aiResponse            — { text, extractedData, isComplete }\n• registrationComplete — { message, extractedData }\n• error                 — { message }\n\nConnect with: io('http://localhost:3001/voice-chat', { transports: ['websocket'] })"
